  <!--EN: time bubble-->
  <Projectile_ChronostaticField_III.label>时间立场</Projectile_ChronostaticField_III.label>
  <!--EN: Accelerate Time applies a field around the target where all physical matter rapidly ages.

When applied to inanimate objects, the effect is instant and will deteriorate items significantly; this can cause an item to disassemble into its base components. There is no area of effect for this function, only the object at the center will be affected.

Living tissue will resist instant change, and requires a more gradual approach. Any living pawn affected will have increased movement and manipulation speed. Neutral elements (plants) will experience rapid growth.

When use at a location or on a hostile enemy, all enemies in the area will be cursed with rapid aging. This will drain rest and energy from the target, accelerate other health conditions, and may inflict age related ailments.

When used on friendly pawns, there is no area of effect, only the primary target will be affected. The aging process for friendly pawns is much more gradual, and may be canceled by Reverse Time.-->
  <TM_AccelerateTime.description>加速时间在目标周围形成一个力场，所有在立场里的物品都会迅速老化。\n\n\n\n当应用于无生命的物体时，物品会迅速老化；这可能会导致物品分解为其基本组件。此技能没有区域效果，只有最中心的对象会受到影响。\n\n\n\n有生命的物体不会被分解，任何受影响的小人都会增加移动速度和操作能力而植物将加速生长。\n\n\n\n当在某个地点或对敌方使用时，该区域内的所有敌人都会因快速老化而受到诅咒。这将消耗目标的精力和能量，加速他的伤口恶化，并可能造成与年龄相关的疾病。\n\n\n\n当用于友军时，没有区域效果，只有主要目标会受到影响。友军小人的老化过程更为缓慢，可能会被逆转未来抵消。</TM_AccelerateTime.description>
  <!--EN: Accelerate Time-->
  <TM_AccelerateTime.label>加速时空</TM_AccelerateTime.label>
  <!--EN: Alter the flow of time to avoid predicted disasters. This ability relies on accurate Predictions to shape the future. Highly skilled chronomancers can revert environmental conditions even after they occur.
	
Alter Fate is most effective against environmental conditions. This ability can backfire, however, causing the event to change, become more severe, or trigger the infamous "butterfly effect."-->
  <TM_AlterFate.description>改变时间流程以避免预测到的灾难。这种能力依靠强大的法则来改变未来。即使在未来已经发生的时间段，一名强大贤者的也能逆转未来。\n\n\n\n逆天改命对自然灾害最为有效。然而，这种能力可能会适得其反，导致事件变得更为严重，或者触发臭名昭著的“蝴蝶效应”。</TM_AlterFate.description>
  <!--EN: Alter Fate-->
  <TM_AlterFate.label>逆天改命</TM_AlterFate.label>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (also referred to as a time bubble) places all living creatures within the effected area out of phase with the flow of time. Interaction with affected creatures is impossible until they are returned to the natural flow of time.

Radius: 3
Range: 40
Cast time: 1s-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField.description>时间立场将切断时间长河，受影响区域内的所有生物与时间流动不同步。无法与受影响的物体交互，直到他们回到现实的时间流。\n\n作用半径：3\n\n施法范围：40\n\n施法时间：1s</TM_ChronostaticField.description>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField.label>时间力场（I）</TM_ChronostaticField.label>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (also referred to as a time bubble) places all living creatures within the effected area out of phase with the flow of time. Interaction with affected creatures is impossible until they are returned to the natural flow of time.

Radius: 3.5
Range: 44
Cast time: .8s-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField_I.description>时间立场将切断时间长河，受影响区域内的所有生物与时间流动不同步。无法与受影响的物体交互，直到他们回到现实的时间流。\n\n作用半径：3.5\n\n施法范围：44\n\n施法时间：0.8s</TM_ChronostaticField_I.description>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (I)-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField_I.label>时间力场（II）</TM_ChronostaticField_I.label>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (also referred to as a time bubble) places all living creatures within the effected area out of phase with the flow of time. Interaction with affected creatures is impossible until they are returned to the natural flow of time.

Radius: 4
Range: 48
Cast time: .6s-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField_II.description>时间立场将切断时间长河，受影响区域内的所有生物与时间流动不同步。无法与受影响的物体交互，直到他们回到现实的时间流。\n\n作用半径：4\n\n施法范围：48\n\n施法时间：0.6s</TM_ChronostaticField_II.description>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (II)-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField_II.label>时间力场（III）</TM_ChronostaticField_II.label>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (also referred to as a time bubble) places all living creatures within the effected area out of phase with the flow of time. Interaction with affected creatures is impossible until they are returned to the natural flow of time.

Radius: 4.5
Range: 50
Cast time: .5s-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField_III.description>时间立场将切断时间长河，受影响区域内的所有生物与时间流动不同步。无法与受影响的物体交互，直到他们回到现实的时间流。\n\n作用半径：4.5\n\n施法范围：50\n\n施法时间：0.5s</TM_ChronostaticField_III.description>
  <!--EN: Chronostatic Field (III)-->
  <TM_ChronostaticField_III.label>时间力场（IV）</TM_ChronostaticField_III.label>
  <!--EN: Enables Prediction - a conscious effort dedicated to deciphering future events. Prediction has two components.
	
The first component is a self-awareness and intuition that makes the chronomancer uncannily difficult to harm, however, this splits the attention of the chronomancer and reduces their physical acuity and speed.

The second component focuses on the prediction of significant events. Indicators such as flight of birds, a cloud of dust, a sound in the wind are highlighted to the chronomancer and woven together into a tapestry depicting a possible future.

Neither method is infallible, but practice can improve the accuracy of prediction and reduce the focus required to sustain it.

This ability reduces mana regeneration by 50%.-->
  <TM_Prediction.description>切换预言能力，一种可以破译未来事件的能力。 预言由两个组成部分。\n\n第一个部分是强化贤者的意识和直觉，这使得贤者非常难以受到外界的伤害，然而，这会分散贤者的注意力并降低他们的敏捷和速度。\n\n第二个部分是对时间长河里的重大事件的预测。 诸如敌人袭击，有毒尘埃，风暴等事件，贤者将看到时间长河里所有的时间线。\n\n这两种方法都不是百分百的，但经验可以提高预测的准确性并减少维持预测所需的法力。\n\n此技能使法力回复减少50％。</TM_Prediction.description>
  <!--EN: Prediction-->
  <TM_Prediction.label>预言术</TM_Prediction.label>
  <!--EN: Returns the caster to a previous point in time. Cannot be used without an active time marker.-->
  <TM_Recall.description>将贤者返回到先前的时间点。没有活动时间标记时该技能不能使用.</TM_Recall.description>
  <!--EN: Recall-->
  <TM_Recall.label>回溯</TM_Recall.label>
  <!--EN: Reverse Time applies a field around the target where all physical matter reverses its natural decay. Reversing the effects of time is more difficult - it requires more energy than accelerating time and can only be applied to a single target at a time.

When applied to inanimate objects, the effect is instant and will regenerate items and restore material to a previous state. Reverse Time can be used to restore rotting food, decaying equipment, and tainted material.

Living tissue will resist instant change and requires a more gradual approach. Any living pawn affected will have decreased movement and manipulation speed and their biological aging will reverse. This can remove many ailments that were caused recently as the tissue is restored to a state prior to the ailment; this includes wounds, diseases, and age related ailments that occurred within the window of time reversal. 

Warning: when used to reverse a death condition, both the chronomancer and pawn returned from death will suffer memory and skill loss.

Reverse Time can be dispelled/countered with Accelerate Time.-->
  <TM_ReverseTime.description>逆转未来在目标周围形成一个力场，立场内的所有物质都会受到影响。逆转未来的施法更困难——它比加速时空需要更多的法力，并且一次只能应用于一个目标。\n\n\n\n当应用于无生命的物体时，将重新生成物品并将材料恢复到以前的状态。逆转未来可以用来恢复腐烂的食物、损坏的的设备和被污染的材料。\n\n\n\n有生命的物体不会被分解。任何受影响的小人都会降低移动速度和操作能力，其生物体征也会发生逆转。如将身体器官逆转到生病前，这可以消除最近引起的许多疾病；这包括在这之前发生的伤口和疾病。\n\n\n\n逆转未来可以通过用加速时空抵消。</TM_ReverseTime.description>
  <!--EN: Reverse Time-->
  <TM_ReverseTime.label>逆转未来</TM_ReverseTime.label>
  <!--EN: The chronomancer is able to capture their status at a specific point in time and return themselves to that point. This ability does not change time or affect anything else besides the chronomancer. The chronomancer will retain any memories they have at the time recall is activated; automated activation from a killing blow can inflict mental breaks since the chronomancer will remember their death.

Recall has a limited effective span (~1 day) before the time marker expires and must be re-applied. When the time marker is active, max MP is reduced by 40 mana and mana regeneration is decreased by 30%.

When set to autocast, the chronomancer will attempt to maintain a recall marker at all times - this does not affect activation triggers (downed/dead) which will always trigger if the skill is learned and time is marked.

To maintain physical cohesion during a recall, the caster will retain all conditions with permanence (missing or added body parts, permanent injuries).  All chronomancer spells are reset following a Recall except Recall itself.-->
  <TM_TimeMark.description>贤者能够捕获它们在特定时间节点的状态，并将自己返回到该时间节点。这种能力不会改变时间也不会影响除了贤者之外的任何其他东西。事件标记将保留在激活时所拥有的任何记忆;受到致命一击的贤者会精神崩溃，因为他们会记住他们的死亡。\n\n\n\n时间标记的有效时间有限(约1天)，过期后必须重新标记。当时间标记激活时，最大法力值减少40法力值，法力回复减少30%。\n\n\n\n当设置为自动施法时，贤者将保持一个标记-—这不会影响激活标记(已关闭/已死亡)，如果学习了技能并标记了时间，标记将始终运行。\n\n\n\n为了在召回过程中保持身体的凝聚力，施法者将保留所有的永久性状态(缺少或增加的身体部分，永久性伤害)。除回溯本身外，所有的法术都在回溯后重置。</TM_TimeMark.description>
  <!--EN: Time Mark-->
  <TM_TimeMark.label>时间标记</TM_TimeMark.label>
</LanguageData>
